ling `/tmp` database).\n4. Click **Deploy**.\n\n---\n\n### What Vercel Will Do Automatically:\n\n- 🌐 **Frontend**: Builds the React + TypeScript + Vite UI from `frontend/` and serves it via Vercel Edge CDN.\n- ⚡ **Backend**: Spins up the Python FastAPI serverless function at `api/index.py` for `/api/*` and `/docs`.\n- 🤖 **ML Engine**: Bundles the 170KB trained model and auto-seeds the 2,480 benchmark transactions on cold start.","thinking":"Checking for Git installation is necessary to assess the user's ability to manage the code repository. Considering various Git options, including command-line, desktop clients, and VS Code's integrated GUI, to determine the most readily available method for code interaction. VS Code's built-in Git GUI presents a potentially immediate solution if the user has VS Code open with the correct folder.\n\n\n"}
